  <notes>Marginal black-letter place names read as "Markgraven Baden", "Rheinzabern", "Berghzabern" (the printed forms are in Fraktur; spelling approximate). Verse lines are printed in italic with a few doubtful letters (e.g. "Yennichis", "Srectanum", "Prusis"), copied as seen. The word "Cratia" at lower right is a catchword. Some marginal notes are attached to the line ends where they stand.</notes>
